{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22913","headline":"登西楼忆行简 · 白居易","name":"登西楼忆行简","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"每因楼上西南望，始觉人间道路长。\n碍日暮山青蔟蔟，漫天秋水白茫茫。\n风波不见三年面，书信难传万里肠。\n早晚东归来下峡，稳乘船舫过瞿唐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}